      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test using a parameterized test approach for better understandability, then compile it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test replaces the ten repetitive `assertEquals` calls with a single `@ParameterizedTest` + `@CsvSource`, making each input/expected-output pair immediately visible in one line and letting JUnit report failures with the auto-generated test name (e.g., `encode(\"brown\") => \"B650\"`)."
